# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The Vizier — environment variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# THIS FILE LISTS NAMES ONLY. It is committed. It must NEVER contain a value.
#
# The real file lives on the server, OUTSIDE this repository:
#
#     /opt/macal-vizier/.env        mode 600, root-owned
#
# Verify a variable is present without printing it:
#     grep -c '^VIZIER_TELEGRAM_TOKEN=.' /opt/macal-vizier/.env      # expect 1
#
# If a value ever lands in a tracked file, that is a LIVE INCIDENT: rotate the
# credential. Removing it from HEAD does not remove it from git history.
# `tools/check_no_secrets.py` fails the build if a secret shape appears in any
# tracked file, including this one.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Telegram — the one door (requirement R1) ──────────────────────────────
# From @BotFather: /newbot. Harden with /setjoingroups -> Disable (DM-only).
VIZIER_TELEGRAM_TOKEN=

# Your numeric Telegram user ID, from @userinfobot. Comma-separated if more
# than one. This is the ALLOWLIST (R1.3): a message from any other ID is
# discarded and audited, and NO model call is made.
# Note: a Telegram bot cannot message a user who has never messaged it first,
# so press Start on the bot once or the daily brief (R4) can never arrive.
VIZIER_TELEGRAM_OWNER_ID=

# ─── Brains (design.md D4) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Groq: console.groq.com -> API Keys. Use a key that belongs to the Vizier
# ALONE — sharing the learning bot's key means one cannot be revoked without
# breaking the other, and a rate-limit storm here would throttle the students'
# bot (R7.5).
VIZIER_GROQ_API_KEY=

# ─── GitHub (requirements R2, R7.4, R7.5) ──────────────────────────────────
# Fine-grained PAT, resource owner `empireenglishcommunity-glitch`.
#   Contents: read+write | Pull requests: read+write | Metadata: read
#   Actions: read | Workflows: NO ACCESS | Administration: NO ACCESS
# The last two are deliberate: the agent cannot edit the checks that catch it,
# and cannot change the branch protection that gates it.
#
# The token ALONE does not prevent a push to `main` — the `protect-main`
# ruleset does (bypass_actors: []). Verified: a direct PUT to main returns
# HTTP 409 "Changes must be made through a pull request."
VIZIER_GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ─── Optional / later phases ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kokoro TTS, already running on the box (Phase 4). OpenAI-compatible.
# VIZIER_KOKORO_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8880/v1

# Ollama on the owner's Windows PC — tier D, the private/offline brain
# (Phase 7). Sensitive ministries route here and NOWHERE else.
# VIZIER_OLLAMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434

# Override the config file location (defaults to ./config.yaml)
# VIZIER_CONFIG=/opt/macal-vizier/config.yaml
